  "corrections": [
    "midi-hardware.md: Both ends do not need dual-role support.",
    "midi-studio-integration.md: Correct Live input routing labels.",
    "midi-synth-handling.md: Latest-state mailboxes lose note transitions between audio blocks.",
    "midi-synth-handling.md: Do not coalesce note-on/off events into a state mailbox.",
    "midi-synth-handling.md: Undefined realtime statuses must be ignored without disturbing state.",
    "midi-hardware.questions.json: Both ends need not be dual-role.",
    "midi-fundamentals.questions.json: Realtime status does not resynchronise/discard incomplete messages.",
    "midi-fundamentals.questions.json: MIDI Sample Dump Standard is an exception to never carries waveform.",
    "midi-synth-handling.questions.json: Disambiguate ISR and audio callback; event queues preserve transitions.",
    "midi-synth-handling.questions.json: Exclude interleaved realtime statuses.",
    "midi-messages.questions.json: Distinguish payload from interleaved realtime stream bytes.",
    "midi-messages.questions.json: Realtime does not clear running status.",
    "midi-audio-levels.questions.json: Series capacitor corner includes source resistance as well as load.",
    "midi-studio-integration.questions.json: Breaking a loop is evidence, not uniquely proving source.",
    "midi-studio-integration.questions.json: Recording compensation is configuration-dependent.",
    "midi-fundamentals.md: Realtime preserves partial messages.",
    "midi-fundamentals.md: Keep pitfall consistent.",
    "midi-messages.md: Differentiate SysEx payload and wire stream.",
    "midi-studio-integration.md: The actual project brief leaves this requirement open.",
    "midi-audio-levels.md: State source resistance assumption.",
    "midi-messages.md: 7D restriction concerns public release, not merely sales.",
    "midi-messages.questions.json: Commercial sales are not the only exclusion on experimental ID 7D.",
